```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "read, accept, seed or adopt the vessel's pin on its floor"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.floor.pins", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.floor.pins"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.floor.pins"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.floor.pins ~ the vessel's floor pin, one per Nexus

`lares vessel floor status|accept [<release>]|seed|adopt` reads and moves the vessel's floor pin. `status` names the pin, the newest release, fast-forward and fork (`grain=canon|seed|shadow|lag|all`); `accept` walks prior from the pin, refusing a non-descendant or an unsettled fork, a hand's act; `seed [genesis=<dir>]` reads the seed a genesis offers (`image=<digest>` prints the pūlama frame); `adopt` previews bare, and `apply=true`, `commit=true` or `revert=true` land or settle a local floor, each the hand's. `nexus=<aid>` names the Nexus, `porch=<origin>` the porch read.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ status · accept · adopt

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`status` params=`act/status ~ read the pin`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`accept` params=`act/accept ~ fast-forward to the sole newest`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`adopt` params=`act/adopt ~ preview the local floor`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ act · release · grain · genesis · image · nexus · porch · apply · commit · revert

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`act` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<status|accept|seed|adopt> ~ status, accept, seed or adopt`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`release` params=`takes/cid seat/2 as/<release> ~ accept: the release to walk to`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grain` params=`takes/word ~ status: canon, seed, shadow, lag or all`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`genesis` params=`takes/dir ~ seed and adopt: the genesis dir`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`image` params=`takes/digest ~ seed: print the pūlama frame for this image`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus whose floor`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`porch` params=`takes/origin ~ the porch origin read`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`apply` params=`~ adopt: land the local floor`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`commit` params=`~ adopt: commit a staged local floor`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`revert` params=`~ adopt: revert a staged local floor`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ status, seed and an adopt preview open to a seat; accept and adopt's landings refuse floor-needs-hand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · floor-not-descendant · floor-fork-unsettled · floor-needs-hand · floor-seed-unread

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.floor.pins act/status]] ~ name status, accept, seed or adopt; adopt takes one of apply=true, commit=true, revert=true`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`floor-not-descendant` params=`~ the release descends from no pin`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`floor-fork-unsettled` params=`~ two heads stand; both named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`floor-needs-hand` params=`~ a seat reads the floor and never accepts or lands`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`floor-seed-unread` params=`~ no seed reads in the genesis dir`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ status · accepted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`status` params=`exit/0 ~ the pin, the founding record, the seed and the drift`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`accepted` params=`exit/0 ~ the pin moved; each live wiki raises reboot-pending`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

